  'Karnataka Royal Bisi Bele Bath',
  'Spiced lentil, rice & mixed vegetable hot pot infused with tamarind, coconut, and ghee-roasted cashews',
  'Originating in the royal kitchens of the Mysore Palace, Bisi Bele Bath is an aromatic one-pot comfort meal of rice and pigeon pea lentils simmered with seasonal squash, shallots, tamarind pulp, freshly roasted spice powder, and golden cashews.',
