  'Bold Tamil Nadu chicken curry with freshly roasted peppercorns, fennel, shallots & star anise',
  'From the spice-trading Chettiyar merchant community of Tamil Nadu. Chicken thighs are simmered in a dark, intensely aromatic masala of black peppercorns, fennel seeds, coriander, shallots, and fresh curry leaves.',
