(
  'kerala-meen-fish-curry',
  'kerala-meen-fish-curry',
  'Malabar Kudampuli Coconut Fish Curry',
  'Wild sea bass simmered in coconut milk, fresh curry leaves & smoky Malabar tamarind',
  'An authentic coastal masterpiece from Kerala. Firm fish steaks are gently poached in an earthenware clay pot (meen chatti) with creamy coconut milk, fresh turmeric, green chilies, and smoky sour Kudampuli (Gamboge tamarind).',
  'Indian',
