),
(
  'hyderabadi-kachchi-dum-biryani',
  'hyderabadi-kachchi-dum-biryani',
  'Royal Hyderabadi Kachchi Dum Biryani',
  'Raw marinated tender meat layered with 70% parboiled saffron basmati rice and sealed with dough',
  'The supreme monarch of festive Indian dining. Bone-in meat is marinated raw (kachchi) in yogurt, fried onions (birista), mint, cilantro, and shahi garam masala, layered under fragrant 70% parboiled long-grain basmati, and dum-sealed with wheat dough to steam in its own juices.',
  'Indian',
  'Hyderabadi',
