  'Bengali Kosha Mangsho (Dark Mutton Curry)',
  'Slow-roasted tender goat meat caramelized in onions, yogurt & whole garam masala',
  'The revered Sunday feast of Kolkata. Tender pieces of bone-in mutton are slowly braised in mustard oil with deeply caramelized onions, ginger, garlic, and whole spices until the gravy darkens to a glistening mahogany coat.',
  'Indian',
