(
  'khaman-dhokla-steamed-spongy',
  'khaman-dhokla-steamed-spongy',
  'Gujarati Khaman Dhokla (Steamed Gram Cakes)',
  'Savory, ultra-spongy steamed chickpea flour cakes with tempered mustard seeds, sesame & green chilies',
  'The beloved sweet-savory street snack of Gujarat. Chickpea flour is whisked with turmeric and lemon, steamed into light and airy golden cakes, and soaked in an aromatic temper of mustard seeds, sesame, curry leaves, and green chilies.',
  'Indian',
