  'Royal Rajasthani Laal Maas',
  'Fiery Mathania red chili & charcoal-smoked tender mutton curry cooked in mustard oil',
  'The legendary hunting feast of Mewar royals. Tender goat meat is slow-cooked in a vibrant crimson sauce of soaked Mathania red chilies, garlic, whole spices, and mustard oil, finished with the traditional dhungar (live charcoal ghee smoke) technique.',
