  'Mumbai Juhu Beach Pav Bhaji',
  'Spiced mashed cauliflower, potato & peas in rich tomato butter gravy with griddled pav rolls',
  'The pride of Mumbai street food. Potatoes, cauliflower, green peas, and bell peppers are mashed on a massive flat tawa with butter, garlic, tomatoes, and spicy pav bhaji masala, served with buttery griddled pav buns and fresh lemon wedges.',
