(
  'kashmiri-rogan-josh-traditional',
  'kashmiri-rogan-josh-traditional',
  'Authentic Kashmiri Rogan Josh',
  'Slow-cooked tender lamb in aromatic fennel, dried ginger & Kashmiri red chili gravy',
  'The crown jewel of Kashmiri Wazwan cuisine. Succulent bone-in lamb is simmered gently in mustard oil with aromatic whole spices, crushed fennel seeds, ginger powder (sonth), and brilliant red Kashmiri chilies until the gravy turns rich and the meat melts in the mouth.',
