  'Crushed flaky potato samosas topped with spiced chole curry, whipped yogurt, sev & tangy chutneys',
  'The most vibrant explosion of flavor in Indian street food. Hot, crispy potato samosas are crushed open into a bowl, ladled with spiced chickpea curry, sweetened whipped curd, zesty mint chutney, tangy tamarind chutney, crunchy nylon sev, and pomegranate seeds.',
