  'Mumbai Railway Vada Pav',
  'Spiced potato fritter in soft pav bun with fiery dry garlic-peanut chutney & green chutney',
  'The beloved pulse of Mumbai. A golden turmeric-spiced potato ball is dipped in spiced chickpea batter, deep-fried until crisp, tucked inside a soft pillowy pav bun with fiery dry red garlic chutney, sweet tamarind, and fried green chilies.',
  'Indian',
