  'Crisp lace-edged fermented rice hoppers with soft pillow center & fragrant coconut vegetable stew',
  'The beloved Sunday breakfast of Kerala. Fermented rice batter with coconut milk and toddy yeast is swirled in a curved appa chatti to create paper-thin lacy golden edges and a soft fluffy cloud center, served with a gentle, fragrant vegetable stew infused with whole spices and coconut cream.',
