  'Earthenware slow-cooked medley of seasonal root vegetables, flat beans & fenugreek muthiya dumplings',
  'The crown celebration dish of Gujarat''s winter harvest. Seasonal surti papdi beans, purple yam (kand), baby eggplants, and sweet potatoes are layered with spiced coconut-cilantro masala and fried fenugreek (methi) muthiya dumplings, slow-simmered in an earthen pot.',
