  'Medley of 8 country vegetables simmered with crushed fresh coconut, cumin, green chilies & raw coconut oil',
  'The soul of the Onam festival banquet (Sadya). Elephant foot yam, raw plantain, drumstick, ash gourd, and carrots are gently steamed, enveloped in freshly crushed raw coconut, cumin, and green chili paste, and finished with sour yogurt and raw coconut oil.',
