  'Thin whole wheat flatbread stuffed with golden cardamom & nutmeg chana dal jaggery paste',
  'The signature festive flatbread of Maharashtra celebrating Gudi Padwa and Holi. Sweet yellow Bengal gram (chana dal) is simmered with sticky jaggery, cardamom, and nutmeg into a fragrant stuffing (puran), wrapped in delicate dough, and roasted in pure ghee.',
