  'Succulent roasted pork tenderloin with red fermented bean curd, five-spice & maltose honey glaze',
  'The crown jewel of Cantonese barbecue (siu mei). Pork tenderloin or shoulder is marinated in fermented red bean curd, Shaoxing wine, five-spice, and soy sauce, roasted at high heat, and basted with glossy caramelized honey-maltose glaze.',
