  'The beloved Tokyo diner comfort food. Chicken cutlets are dredged in featherlight Japanese panko breadcrumbs, fried to a shatteringly crisp golden crust, sliced into strips, and served over short-grain rice with a fragrant, mildly sweet curry infused with grated apple and honey.',
