  'Crisp scorched rice in hot stone bowl topped with seasoned namul, marinated beef & gochujang',
  'The iconic sizzling stone pot rice bowl of Korea. Steamed short-grain rice develops a golden, crunchy crust (nurungji) at the bottom of a sesame-oiled granite bowl, topped with spinach, bean sprouts, carrots, seasoned beef, and a golden fried egg with sweet-spicy gochujang.',
