(
  'korean-fried-chicken-dakgangjeong',
  'korean-fried-chicken-dakgangjeong',
  'Crispy Korean Fried Chicken (Dakgangjeong)',
  'Double-fried ultra-crunchy chicken wings glazed in sticky sweet-spicy garlic gochujang',
  'The gold standard of fried chicken. Chicken wings are tossed in potato starch, double-fried for an impossible crunch that stays crispy for hours, and coated in a glossy, bubbling reduction of gochujang, honey, garlic, ginger, and toasted sesame seeds.',
  'Asian',
