  'vietnamese-pho-bo-beef-soup',
  'Traditional Hanoi Pho Bo (Beef Noodle Soup)',
  'Slow-simmered 12-hour star anise & charred ginger bone broth with tender beef brisket & flat rice noodles',
  'The soul of Vietnamese culinary heritage. Beef marrow bones and brisket are slow-simmered for hours with charred shallots, fresh ginger, cinnamon quills, star anise, and black cardamom, ladled steaming hot over flat rice noodles and thin slices of tender beef.',
