  'The legendary street peddler noodles of Sichuan. Fresh wheat noodles are tossed in a dark, fiery sauce of toasted sesame paste, dark soy sauce, Chinkiang vinegar, and Sichuan chili oil, crowned with crispy wok-fried minced pork and crunchy Sui Mi Ya Cai (pickled mustard greens).',
