  'Bangkok Sweet Mango Sticky Rice (Khao Niew Mamuang)',
  'Warm coconut milk-soaked sweet glutinous rice with slices of ripe honey mango & toasted mung beans',
  'Thailand''s world-adored royal dessert. Sweet glutinous sticky rice is steamed and steeped in warm, salted coconut cream with palm sugar, served alongside slices of chilled, perfumed ripe honey mango, and drizzled with thick salted coconut sauce and crisp toasted mung beans.',
