  'Thinly sliced beef & sweet yellow onions simmered in dashi, mirin & soy sauce over steamed white rice',
  'The beloved everyday staple of Tokyo. Paper-thin ribbons of marbled beef and sweet onions are gently simmered in a savory-sweet dashi broth flavored with soy sauce, mirin, and sake, ladled with broth over fluffy steamed rice with beni shoga (red pickled ginger).',
