  'tom-yum-goong-lemongrass-soup',
  'tom-yum-goong-lemongrass-soup',
  'Bangkok Royal Tom Yum Goong',
  'Spicy & sour lemongrass, galangal & kaffir lime leaf broth with jumbo river prawns & straw mushrooms',
  'The world-famous aromatic clear soup of Thailand. Plump river prawns are simmered in an electric broth infused with crushed lemongrass stalks, fresh galangal, torn kaffir lime leaves, bird''s eye chilies, fish sauce, and lime juice with oyster mushrooms.',
