  'Day-old Jasmine rice wok-seared with shrimp, honey char siu pork, sweet peas & scrambled eggs',
  'The gold standard of Chinese banquet fried rice hailing from Yangzhou. Cold dry jasmine rice is wok-seared at blazing heat with sweet honey-glazed char siu pork, plump pink shrimp, scrambled eggs, sweet peas, and scallions with signature smoky wok hei aroma.',
