  'Crisp-crusted rice flour baguette stuffed with pork liver pâté, Vietnamese cold cuts, pickled daikon & fresh cilantro',
  'The crown jewel of French-Vietnamese street food fusion. An impossibly light, crackly baguette is smeared with creamy liver pâté and French mayonnaise, layered with savory Vietnamese pork roll (cha lua), sweet-sour pickled carrots and daikon, cucumber batons, jalapeño, and fresh cilantro with Maggi seasoning.',
