  'korean-kimchi-jjigae-pork',
  'Soulful Korean Kimchi Jjigae',
  'Deeply aged fermented sour kimchi stew with pork belly, scallions & soft tofu',
  'The beating heart of Korean home cooking. Well-fermented, sour aged kimchi is stir-fried in sesame oil with pork belly, garlic, and gochugaru, then simmered in anchovy kelp broth with silken tofu and scallions until rich and deeply satisfying.',
