  'Chewy dangmyeon noodles stir-fried with beef strips, shiitake mushrooms, spinach & toasted sesame',
  'The royal celebration dish of Korea. Translucent, chewy dangmyeon (sweet potato glass noodles) are boiled, seasoned with sweet soy sauce and sesame oil, and tossed with individually sautéed beef, wood ear mushrooms, spinach, and sweet carrots.',
