  'Artisanal Neapolitan Pizza Margherita',
  'Slow-fermented blistered crust with sweet San Marzano tomatoes, fresh buffalo mozzarella & basil',
  'The pure essence of Italian culinary simplicity. A high-hydration dough fermented for 48 hours is hand-stretched, topped with crushed sweet San Marzano tomatoes, creamy mozzarella di bufala, fresh basil leaves, and a ribbon of extra virgin olive oil, baked at blisteringly high heat.',
