  'authentic-spaghetti-carbonara',
  'Classic Roman Spaghetti alla Carbonara',
  'Crispy guanciale, farm egg yolks, Pecorino Romano & freshly cracked tellicherry black pepper',
  'The gold standard of Roman pasta craftsmanship. Al dente spaghetti is tossed with rendered crispy cured pork cheek (guanciale), creamy farm egg yolks, aged Pecorino Romano cheese, and abundant cracked black pepper—with zero cream.',
  'Italian',
