  'classic-italian-tiramisu',
  'Classic Treviso Espresso Tiramisu',
  'Espresso & dark rum-dipped savoiardi ladyfingers layered with velvety mascarpone zabaione and cocoa',
  'The iconic dessert born in Treviso, Veneto. Crisp Italian savoiardi ladyfingers are flash-dipped in freshly brewed espresso and dark rum, layered with a cloud-like whipped cream of egg yolks, cane sugar, and rich Italian mascarpone, dusted generously with Dutch-process cocoa.',
