  'The authentic, world-revered rice dish from the orchards and coastal plains of Valencia. Spanish Bomba rice is slowly simmered in an open wide paella pan with chicken, flat green beans (ferraura), white butter beans, sweet paprika, and golden saffron, forming a prized, crispy caramelized bottom crust (socarrat).',
