  'greek-moussaka-layered-lamb',
  'Traditional Athens Greek Moussaka',
  'Layered roasted eggplant, spiced minced lamb with cinnamon & wine, crowned with fluffy golden béchamel',
  'The grand matriarch of Greek celebratory dining. Slices of tender roasted eggplant and potatoes are layered with slow-simmered minced lamb infused with cinnamon, oregano, and red wine, crowned with a cloud of velvety egg-enriched béchamel that bakes into a bronzed golden crust.',
