  '"9x13 baking casserole dish","Whisk & saucepan for béchamel","Baking sheet for roasting eggplant"',
  '[{"name":"Globe eggplants, sliced 1/2-inch thick","amount":2,"unit":"large","notes":"Salted & roasted","category":"Produce"},{"name":"Yukon gold potatoes, peeled & sliced","amount":400,"unit":"g","notes":"Base layer","category":"Produce"},{"name":"Ground lamb or lean beef","amount":650,"unit":"g","notes":"Spiced meat sauce","category":"Proteins"},{"name":"Crushed tomatoes & tomato paste","amount":400,"unit":"g","notes":"Sauce base","category":"Pantry"},{"name":"Greek cinnamon stick & ground cloves","amount":1,"unit":"tsp","notes":"Signature Greek spice","category":"Spices"},{"name":"Whole milk & butter","amount":3,"unit":"cups","notes":"For béchamel","category":"Dairy"},{"name":"All-purpose flour","amount":0.3,"unit":"cup","notes":"Roux thickener","category":"Pantry"},{"name":"Egg yolks & Kefalotyri or Parmesan cheese","amount":2,"unit":"yolks","notes":"Whisked into béchamel","category":"Dairy"}]'::jsonb,
  '[{"step":1,"title":"Roast Eggplant & Potato Slices","instruction":"Brush sliced eggplants and potatoes with olive oil, sprinkle with sea salt, and roast at 400°F (200°C) for 20 minutes until golden and tender.","time":"20 mins","temp":"400°F (200°C)","visualCue":"Tender, caramelized golden eggplant rounds."},{"step":2,"title":"Simmer Spiced Lamb Sauce","instruction":"Brown ground lamb with onions and garlic. Add red wine, crushed tomatoes, cinnamon stick, oregano, and cloves. Simmer 25 mins until thick and rich with minimal loose liquid.","time":"25 mins","temp":"Medium heat","visualCue":"Aromatic, thick spiced meat sauce with no excess water."},{"step":3,"title":"Whisk Fluffy Béchamel","instruction":"Melt butter in saucepan, whisk in flour for 2 minutes. Gradually whisk in warm milk until smooth and thickened. Off heat, whisk in egg yolks, grated cheese, and nutmeg.","time":"8 mins","temp":"Medium heat","visualCue":"Silky, thick custard-like white sauce."},{"step":4,"title":"Layer & Bake to Golden Bronze","instruction":"In baking dish, layer potatoes, roasted eggplant, spiced lamb sauce, and pour thick béchamel over top. Bake at 375°F (190°C) for 45 minutes until top is bronzed and bubbling. Rest 20 minutes before slicing.","time":"45 mins","temp":"375°F (190°C)","visualCue":"Puffy, golden-brown gratin crust that cuts into neat square layers."}]'::jsonb,
  '"Roasting the eggplant instead of frying prevents the dish from becoming greasy.","Let the baked moussaka rest for 20-30 minutes before cutting; this sets the béchamel so clean, gorgeous layers can be served."',
  '[{"original":"Ground lamb","alternative":"Lean ground beef or lentils","notes":"Beef is widely used across Greece; lentils create a stunning vegetarian version"}]'::jsonb,
  '[{"mistake":"Slicing immediately out of the oven","remedy":"Patience is key; hot béchamel will spill out if not rested."}]'::jsonb,
  '"Gluten","Dairy","Eggs"',
  'Baking dish retains intense heat; allow to set safely on counter.',
  'Refrigerate up to 4 days; reheats spectacularly.',
  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80',
  false,
