  'Layered golden fried eggplant, slow-cooked San Marzano marinara, sweet basil & melted mozzarella',
  'The timeless pride of Southern Italy. Thick slices of eggplant are lightly dusted in flour, fried golden, and layered in a baking dish with sweet San Marzano tomato passata, fragrant fresh basil, creamy fior di latte mozzarella, and aged Parmigiano Reggiano.',
