  'tortilla-espanola-potato-omelette',
  'Classic Madrid Tortilla Española',
  'Slow olive oil-poached Yukon potatoes and caramelized sweet onions folded in farm eggs',
  'The beating heart of Spanish tapas culture. Yukon gold potatoes and sweet onions are gently poached in abundant Spanish extra virgin olive oil until meltingly soft, folded with farm-fresh beaten eggs, and cooked to a golden disc with a tender, custardy center.',
  'European',
