  '"Vegetarian","Gluten-Free","Breakfast","Brunch","Tapass","Quick Meals","Spanish","European","Eggetarian","Dairy-Free","Nut-Free","Low-Sugar"',
  '"10-inch non-stick skillet","Flat plate or lid for flipping"',
  '[{"name":"Yukon gold potatoes, peeled & sliced 1/8-inch","amount":600,"unit":"g","notes":"Thin uniform half-moons","category":"Produce"},{"name":"Yellow sweet onion, thinly sliced","amount":1,"unit":"large","notes":"Slowly poached","category":"Produce"},{"name":"Farm fresh eggs","amount":6,"unit":"large","notes":"Lightly beaten with salt","category":"Dairy"},{"name":"Spanish extra virgin olive oil","amount":1.5,"unit":"cups","notes":"For gentle oil poaching (drained & reused)","category":"Pantry"},{"name":"Flaky sea salt","amount":1.5,"unit":"tsp","notes":"To taste","category":"Pantry"}]'::jsonb,
  '[{"step":1,"title":"Slow Olive Oil Poach","instruction":"Submerge sliced potatoes and onions in olive oil over medium-low heat. Poach gently for 18-20 minutes until potatoes are completely tender when poked with a fork, without browning.","time":"20 mins","temp":"Low-medium heat","visualCue":"Potatoes are buttery soft and onions are translucent."},{"step":2,"title":"Drain & Warm Egg Soak","instruction":"Strain potatoes and onions over a bowl (save the oil for cooking!). While warm, fold potatoes into the beaten eggs with salt. Rest 10 minutes so starches absorb.","time":"10 mins","temp":"Room temp","visualCue":"Warm potatoes soften the eggs into a thick custard."},{"step":3,"title":"Sear & Form Cake","instruction":"Heat 1 tbsp reserved olive oil in 10-inch non-stick skillet on medium heat. Pour in egg-potato mixture. Cook 3 minutes, running a spatula around the edge to tuck into a round disc.","time":"3 mins","temp":"Medium heat","visualCue":"Bottom and edges set into a smooth golden cake."},{"step":4,"title":"The Confident Plate Flip","instruction":"Place a flat plate over the skillet and confidently invert in one swift motion. Slide the tortilla back into the pan to cook the second side for 2 minutes until set outside with a juicy, tender center.","time":"3 mins","temp":"Medium heat","visualCue":"Even golden disc that yields slightly when pressed."}]'::jsonb,
  '"The potatoes must be poached in oil gently rather than fried; they should turn meltingly soft without developing a brown crust.","Flipping requires confidence: hold the plate firmly against the pan and flip with one swift wrist rotation over the sink."',
  '[{"original":"With onion","alternative":"Without onion (Tortilla sin cebolla)","notes":"The great Spanish culinary debate"}]'::jsonb,
  '[{"mistake":"Cooking on high heat","remedy":"High heat burns the outside while leaving the interior raw; gentle heat creates uniform silkiness."}]'::jsonb,
  '"Eggs"',
  'Ensure skillet is not overly heavy when performing the plate flip.',
  'Tastes even better at room temperature; keeps 3 days refrigerated.',
  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584776296944-ab6fb57b0bdd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80',
  false,
