  'gambas-al-ajillo-garlic-shrimp',
  'gambas-al-ajillo-garlic-shrimp',
  'Sizzling Tapas Gambas al Ajillo',
  'Plump wild shrimp sizzling in extra virgin olive oil, slivered garlic, dry sherry & red chili flakes',
  'The most iconic tapas dish across Spanish tabernas. Plump, sweet shrimp are flash-sautéed in abundant bubbling extra virgin olive oil infused with thinly sliced garlic, dried red cayenne chilies, and a splash of dry amontillado sherry, served with crusty bread to sop up the garlic oil.',
