  '"Clay cazuela or cast iron skillet","Tongs"',
  '[{"name":"Wild tiger shrimp or prawns, peeled & deveined","amount":450,"unit":"g","notes":"Tails intact, patted bone-dry","category":"Proteins"},{"name":"Spanish extra virgin olive oil","amount":0.5,"unit":"cup","notes":"Top grade fruity oil","category":"Pantry"},{"name":"Garlic cloves, thinly sliced","amount":10,"unit":"cloves","notes":"Generous garlic","category":"Produce"},{"name":"Dry Spanish sherry (Fino or Manzanilla)","amount":2,"unit":"tbsp","notes":"Deglazing pan","category":"Pantry"},{"name":"Dried red chili flakes or cayenne pepper","amount":1,"unit":"tsp","notes":"Gentle heat","category":"Spices"},{"name":"Fresh flat-leaf parsley, finely chopped","amount":0.25,"unit":"cup","notes":"Fresh finish","category":"Produce"},{"name":"Crusty artisan bread","amount":1,"unit":"loaf","notes":"For dipping garlic oil","category":"Pantry"}]'::jsonb,
  '[{"step":1,"title":"Gently Sizzle Garlic in Olive Oil","instruction":"Combine olive oil and sliced garlic in cold skillet over medium-low heat. Cook 3 minutes until garlic turns pale straw-gold and perfumes oil. Add chili flakes.","time":"4 mins","temp":"Medium-low heat","visualCue":"Gentle tiny bubbles around sweet golden garlic chips."},{"step":2,"title":"High-Heat Sizzle Shrimp","instruction":"Increase heat to high. Add dry seasoned shrimp in a single layer. Sear for 90 seconds without moving until pink on bottom.","time":"2 mins","temp":"High heat","visualCue":"Shrimp sizzle vigorously in fragrant oil."},{"step":3,"title":"Flip & Deglaze with Sherry","instruction":"Flip shrimp, pour in dry sherry and chopped parsley. Sizzle for 60 seconds until shrimp curl into tender pink crescents. Remove from heat immediately.","time":"1 min","temp":"High heat","visualCue":"Sherry creates cloudy, emulsion-like savory sauce with garlic oil."},{"step":4,"title":"Serve Sizzling with Bread","instruction":"Carry skillet straight to the table while still sizzling. Serve immediately with warm crusty bread to mop up every drop of garlic oil.","time":"1 min","temp":"Sizzling hot","visualCue":"Aromatic oil bubbling around tender coral shrimp."}]'::jsonb,
  '"Start the garlic in cold olive oil so it infuses its sweet flavor gradually into the oil without scorching.","The garlic-infused olive oil is just as prized as the shrimp; serve with plenty of warm bread."',
  '[{"original":"Dry sherry","alternative":"Dry white wine or fresh lemon juice","notes":"Bright acidity"}]'::jsonb,
  '[{"mistake":"Burning the garlic","remedy":"Keep heat gentle; bitter brown garlic ruins the entire olive oil infusion."}]'::jsonb,
  '"Shellfish"',
  'Hot oil bubbles vigorously; bring skillet to table on a heatproof trivet.',
  'Eat immediately while hot.',
  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535400255456-984241443b29?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80',
