),
(
  'chicken-souvlaki-tzatziki-pita',
  'chicken-souvlaki-tzatziki-pita',
  'Greek Island Chicken Souvlaki with Tzatziki',
  'Skewered char-grilled chicken marinated in Greek oregano, garlic & lemon with cucumber-garlic tzatziki & warm pita',
  'The quintessential Greek summer feast. Boneless chicken thighs are marinated in extra virgin olive oil, wild dried oregano, lemon juice, and garlic, skewered and grilled over open flame until juicy with smoky charred edges, served with cold strained cucumber tzatziki and warm oiled pita.',
