),
(
  'lasagna-alla-bolognese-baked',
  'lasagna-alla-bolognese-baked',
  'Bologna Classic Lasagna alla Bolognese',
  'Seven delicate layers of egg pasta, slow-simmered beef & pork ragù, silky béchamel & Parmigiano Reggiano',
  'The gold standard of Emilia-Romagna festive dining. Handmade egg pasta sheets are layered with rich, 3-hour simmered beef and pork ragù, silky nutmeg-scented béchamel sauce, and freshly grated Parmigiano Reggiano, baked into golden, bubbling perfection.',
