  'Chewy egg tonnarelli pasta emulsified with Pecorino Romano cheese & freshly toasted black pepper',
  'The ultimate test of Italian culinary technique with just 3 ingredients: pasta, cheese, and pepper. Square-cut Roman tonnarelli noodles are tossed with freshly toasted, coarsely ground black peppercorns and aged Pecorino Romano cheese emulsified with starchy pasta cooking water into velvet.',
