  'Madrid Crispy Fluted Churros con Chocolate',
  'Golden fluted fried pastry dough rolled in cinnamon sugar with thick Spanish dipping chocolate',
  'The quintessential Madrid morning indulgence. Choux-like pastry dough is piped through a star nozzle directly into hot oil, fried until shatteringly crisp and fluted, dusted in cinnamon sugar, and served with velvety thick bittersweet Spanish dipping chocolate.',
