  'Madrid Crispy Patatas Bravas',
  'Crisp golden potato cubes tossed in spicy smoked pimentón bravas sauce with garlic allioli',
  'The quintessential king of Spanish tapas. Parboiled russet potatoes are fried to a glass-like crunch, smothered in fiery Spanish smoked paprika bravas sauce, and finished with a dollop of rich, silky garlic allioli.',
