  'Traditional Greek Spanakopita (Spinach Feta Pie)',
  'Flaky golden butter-brushed filo pastry layers stuffed with fresh spinach, barrel-aged feta, dill & lemon',
  'The most beloved savory pastry of the Greek islands. Layers of whisper-thin filo dough are brushed with olive oil and butter, baked around a fragrant filling of fresh spinach, creamy sheep''s milk feta, scallions, fresh dill, and farm eggs until golden, flaky, and aromatic.',
