  'Mexico City Tacos al Pastor',
  'Thinly sliced pork marinated in achiote, guajillo chiles & pineapple juice, seared with grilled pineapple',
  'The street food crown jewel of Mexico City. Pork shoulder is marinated in earthy achiote paste, guajillo chiles, Mexican oregano, and fresh pineapple juice, seared until caramelized with sweet charred pineapple, white onion, and cilantro on warm corn tortillas.',
