),
(
  'fresh-guacamole-totopos',
  'fresh-guacamole-totopos',
  'Molcajete Guacamole Tradicional with Fresh Totopos',
  'Crushed Hass avocados with jalapeño, lime, cilantro & warm homemade crispy tortilla chips',
  'The definitive Mexican appetizer crafted table-side in a lava stone molcajete. Ripe Hass avocados are coarsely mashed with an aromatic paste of serrano chiles, white onions, sea salt, and cilantro, served with freshly fried sea-salted corn totopos.',
