  'The undisputed champion of American diner culture. Cold 80/20 ground chuck meatballs are smashed flat against a blistering cast iron skillet to create shatteringly crisp, caramelized lace edges, topped with melted American cheddar, pickles, and creamy special sauce on a toasted brioche bun.',
