  'Crisp spiced cornstarch-dredged chicken thighs over fluffy Belgian waffles with hot cayenne honey',
  'The soul food union of crispy savory poultry and sweet griddled waffle. Chicken thighs are brined in spiced buttermilk, dredged in seasoned flour with cornstarch, fried until crackling crisp, and crowned over malted Belgian waffles with warm cayenne-spiced hot honey.',
