  'Ultra-velvety whipped chickpeas with nutty sesame tahini, iced water, cumin, za''atar & warm pita',
  'The gold standard of Levantine mezze. Dried chickpeas are cooked with baking soda until skins slip off effortlessly, pureed hot with nutty stone-ground tahini, garlic, lemon juice, and iced water until light as air, finished with olive oil and toasted pine nuts.',
