  'Jerusalem Crispy Green Herb Falafel',
  'Golden crunchy chickpea patties loaded with fresh parsley, cilantro, dill, cumin & tangy lemon tahini',
  'The street snack benchmark of the Middle East. Raw soaked chickpeas (never canned) are ground coarsely with mountain loads of fresh parsley, cilantro, garlic, toasted cumin, and coriander, shaped into patties and fried until shatteringly crisp outside and fluffy emerald green inside.',
