  'Smoky fire-roasted tomato, red bell pepper & Scotch bonnet long grain rice with sweet fried dodo plantains',
  'The pride of West African celebration gastronomy. Extra-long grain parboiled rice is steeped in an aromatic reduction of fire-roasted plum tomatoes, red bell peppers, onions, and spicy Scotch bonnet peppers with thyme, curry powder, and bay leaves, cooked until a rich, smoky bottom crust develops.',
