  'Moroccan Royal Lamb Tagine with Honey Prunes',
  'Slow-simmered bone-in lamb with ras el hanout, sweet prunes, toasted almonds & sesame in clay pot',
  'The pinnacle of Moroccan celebratory feasts. Lamb shanks or shoulder are slow-simmered in a conical clay tagine with ras el hanout, ginger, saffron, and sweet onions, topped with honey-glazed cinnamon prunes, golden toasted almonds, and sesame seeds.',
