  'turkish-adana-kebab-lamb',
  'Traditional Turkish Adana Kebab',
  'Hand-minced spiced lamb with sweet red peppers on flat skewers with sumac onions & lavash',
  'The pride of Southern Turkey. Hand-minced lamb shoulder and tail fat are kneaded with finely minced sweet red peppers, chili flakes, and salt, molded onto wide flat iron skewers, and grilled over charcoal embers, served over warm lavash with sumac-marinated red onions.',
