  'Michoacán Crispy Pork Carnitas',
  'Slow-confit pork shoulder in citrus, lard & Mexican spices, shredded and crisped on high heat',
  'The gold standard of Mexican pork carnitas from Michoacán. Pork shoulder is slow-braised gently in rendered lard, orange juice, Mexican oregano, and condensed milk until meltingly tender, then shredded and flash-broiled until the edges turn shatteringly crisp.',
