  'turkish-menemen-soft-scrambled',
  'turkish-menemen-soft-scrambled',
  'Turkish Cafe Menemen (Soft Scrambled Eggs)',
  'Soft-set eggs scrambled with sweet green peppers, ripe summer tomatoes, butter & warm crusty bread',
  'The beloved everyday brunch obsession of Istanbul. Sweet Turkish green peppers and ripe summer tomatoes are slowly cooked in butter and olive oil until jammy, then farm eggs are cracked directly in and folded softly into creamy ribbons, served sizzling in a copper pan.',
  'Middle Eastern',
