  '15-Minute High-Protein Paneer Bhurji',
  'Scrambled fresh cottage cheese with ginger, garlic, tomatoes, green chilies & warm sourdough toast',
  'The ultimate 15-minute quick, high-protein vegetarian breakfast or post-workout dinner. Crumbled fresh paneer is tossed in a hot skillet with sautéed onions, ginger, tomatoes, turmeric, pav bhaji masala, and fresh cilantro, served with buttery warm toasted sourdough.',
