  '15-Minute Crispy Tofu Sesame Poke Bowl',
  'Golden pan-crisped tofu cubes tossed in sweet soy glaze over warm brown rice with edamame & avocado',
  'A 15-minute vibrant, plant-powered high-protein dinner. Firm tofu cubes are cornstarch-crisped in sesame oil, tossed in a sweet soy-ginger glaze, and served over warm rice with sliced avocado, steamed edamame, shredded carrots, and toasted nori.',
