  'creamy-vegan-butternut-squash-soup',
  'creamy-vegan-butternut-squash-soup',
  'Velvety Roasted Butternut Squash & Coconut Soup',
  'Oven-roasted butternut squash & crisp apples pureed with coconut cream, fresh ginger & spiced toasted pepitas',
  'The ultimate cozy autumn bowl. Sweet butternut squash is roasted with honeycrisp apples, garlic, and fresh ginger until caramelized, pureed silky-smooth with creamy coconut milk and warm nutmeg, garnished with spiced crunchy pumpkin seeds.',
  'Quick Meals',
