  'Fluffy Blender Blueberry Banana Oat Pancakes',
  'Naturally sweet gluten-free rolled oats & ripe banana blended into fluffy golden pancakes with fresh blueberries',
  'The 15-minute wholesome breakfast sensation. Rolled oats, ripe bananas, almond milk, and ground cinnamon are blended smooth, poured onto a hot griddle with bursting fresh blueberries, and stacked high with pure Vermont maple syrup.',
  'Breakfast',
