  'The pinnacle of Bengali confectionary artistry. Delicate disks of fresh hand-kneaded cow-milk chenna are poached in light bubbling syrup until cloud-spongy, then steeped in thickened saffron-infused cream crowned with slivered pistachios and fragrant dried rose petals.',
